    "id": "c6_Design_Pattern/2. structural/2.2 adapter/example_payment.py",
    "title": "example_payment.py",
    "group": "2. structural",
    "code": true,
    "html": "<pre><code>class OldPaymentMachine:\n    #only use cents\n    def make_payment(self, dollars):\n        print(f&quot;Paid ${dollars}&quot;)\n\nclass PaymentAdapter:\n    def __init__(self, old_payment_machine):\n        self.old_payment_machine = old_payment_machine\n\n    def pay(self, amount):\n        # Convert the amount to dollars and use the old payment machine\n        dollars = amount / 100  # Assuming amount is in cents\n        self.old_payment_machine.make_payment(dollars) \ndef main():\n    old_payment_machine = OldPaymentMachine()\n    payment_adapter = PaymentAdapter(old_payment_machine)\n\n    # Pay $10 using the adapter (amount in cents)\n    payment_adapter.pay(1000)  # 1000 cents = $10\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\n    main()       <\/code><\/pre>",
    "text": "class OldPaymentMachine:\n    #only use cents\n    def make_payment(self, dollars):\n        print(f\"Paid ${dollars}\")\n\nclass PaymentAdapter:\n    def __init__(self, old_payment_machine):\n        self.old_payment_machine = old_payment_machine\n\n    def pay(self, amount):\n        # Convert the amount to dollars and use the old payment machine\n        dollars = amount / 100  # Assuming amount is in cents\n        self.old_payment_machine.make_payment(dollars) \ndef main():\n    old_payment_machine = OldPaymentMachine()\n    payment_adapter = PaymentAdapter(old_payment_machine)\n\n    # Pay $10 using the adapter (amount in cents)\n    payment_adapter.pay(1000)  # 1000 cents = $10\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()       "
